<v Ira Glass>[鸣谢]

00:56:53.750 --> 00:57:04.770
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is distributed by Public Radio International. WBEZ management oversight for our show by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatea, who explains his boyhood dream to someday work at a radio station this way.
<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由美国公共广播国际公司发行。WBEZ的管理层监督由我们的老板，托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责，他这样解释自己童年时梦想有朝一日在广播电台工作的愿望。

00:57:04.770 --> 00:57:12.790
<v Woman>At school and at the university, we'd been taught that this was a magical factory, where people in white robes sat and pushed buttons.
<v Woman>在学校和大学里，我们被教导说这是一个魔术工厂，人们身穿白袍，坐在那儿按按钮。

00:57:12.790 --> 00:57:21.150
<v Ira Glass>And indeed, that's what it's like. I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>事实确实如此，就是这样。我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多关于《美国生活》的故事。

00:57:21.150 --> 00:57:26.150
<v Announcer>PRI. Public Radio International.
<v Announcer>PRI。美国公共广播国际公司。
